  "description": "Eyes like emeralds, blonde hair, and lips as red as roses. This is how Elizabeth describes herself to her fiancé, the blind Archduke Thesion Romanov. The problem: the woman sitting before him is none other than Cynthia White, a commoner stand-in for the deceased Elizabeth! Deep in debt, Cynthia was forced into this fraudulent act... but how long can she keep it up before being discovered? And will she be able to exit the stage despite the archduke growing more and more fond of her company...?\nSource: Tapas",
